{"sections":[{"slug":"既约概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"既约概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">既约概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"既约概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称满足如下等价条件的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为既约概形</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对每点</span> $x\\in X$, <span lang=\"zh\">茎</span> $\\mathcal O_{X,x}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/既约环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">既约环</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即没有非零的幂零元</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">存在仿射开覆盖</span> $\\{\\operatorname{Spec}A_i \\to X\\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中每个</span> $A_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">都是既约环</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">开集</span> $U\\hookrightarrow X$, $\\Gamma(\\mathcal O_X,U)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是既约环</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">既约概形等价于在</span> $\\mathrm{Sh}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $\\mathcal O_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为既约环</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函子式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/函子式代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子式代数几何</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span>\n$i\\colon \\mathsf{Aff}_{\\mathrm{red}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Aff}$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为既约仿射概形</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/既约环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">既约环</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的子范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么既约概形可视为</span> $\\mathsf{Aff}_{\\mathrm{red}}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">带有</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑的限制</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">满足某种局部可表性的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{LKE}_iX$: <span lang=\"zh\">对于任意仿射概形</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}A$,\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n&amp;(\\operatorname{LKE}_iX)(\\operatorname{Spec}A) \\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{colim}\\limits_{\r\n            \\operatorname{Spec} A\\to \\operatorname{Spec}R\r\n    }\r\n    X(\\operatorname{Spec}R)  (R\\in \\mathsf{Ring}_{\\mathrm{red}}).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形的约化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形的约化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">约化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">既约概形的子范畴的嵌入</span> $\\mathsf{Sch}_{\\mathrm{red}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Sch}$ <span lang=\"zh\">有右伴随</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于既约概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">和任意概形</span> $Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一地穿过</span> $Y_{\\mathrm{red}}$. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形的约化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形的约化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部闭子集上的既约子概形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部闭子集</span> $Z$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在唯一的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部闭嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部闭嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Y\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为既约概形且其像集为</span> $Z$, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span> $Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">确定的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">既约子概形</span></strong> $Z_{\\mathrm{red}}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\operatorname{Spec} k[x]/(x^2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是既约概形</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\operatorname{Spec}k[x,y]/(xy)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是既约概形</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">既约概形的乘积不一定是既约概形</span>:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb F_p \\times \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[t]/(t^2-p) = \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb F_p [t]/(t^2).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}